Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:03.85,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}只要能遇見你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.10,0:02:08.48,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}世界也可以輕易顛覆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:15.40,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}前路充滿未知  只需要笑臉相迎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.65,0:02:21.70,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}就還能走得很長很長
