Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:32.75,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}心中的思緒不可撼動
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:43.85,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3cFFFFFF\bord3\blur2.5\1aFF}追求無人知曉的頂點  竭盡全力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:45.64,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}あきらめちゃっていいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:49.60,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}やめちゃえって思うのに
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:52.94,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}逃げ出すことさえできなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:56.61,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}フラフラ、フラフラ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:21:00.40,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自信が無くてそのせいで
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:04.36,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自分自身も出せなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:07.83,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}自信無くしてスパイラル
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.41,0:21:11.54,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}グルグル、グルグル
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:17.88,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}でも出逢えたから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:24.72,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}もう見失わないよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.47,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}笑顔があれば、
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:29.14,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:30.97,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}豪華な品も
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:32.77,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}派手な飾りも、
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.89,0:21:34.48,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.69,0:21:36.52,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}食卓囲もう
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:38.31,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}昨日のミスも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.44,0:21:40.15,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}不安な明日も
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:41.32,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}添えて
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.69,0:21:43.82,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}ねぇ、いらない何も
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.70,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}凝った味付けも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:47.57,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}シャレた盛り付けも、
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.66,0:21:49.28,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}いらないから
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.53,0:21:51.29,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}涙の味はも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.33,0:21:53.08,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}しょっぱいとしても
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.20,0:21:55.08,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}最後にいつも
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:58.46,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}笑えたら
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.67,0:22:01.75,edjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\fad(200,200)}それがスパイス
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:45.64,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}明明放棄比較好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:49.60,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}明明想著不要做了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:52.94,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但是卻連逃開也做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:56.61,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}搖搖晃晃  搖搖晃晃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:21:00.40,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}因為缺乏自信
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.78,0:21:04.36,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不會好好表達自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:07.83,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}在丟失了自信的螺旋裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.41,0:21:11.54,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一圈一圈  一圈一圈
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.12,0:21:17.88,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}但是已經相遇了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.50,0:21:24.72,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不會再弄丟了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.55,0:21:27.47,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}只要有了笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.51,0:21:29.14,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}多餘的東西也好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.22,0:21:30.97,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}豪華的餐品也好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.06,0:21:32.77,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}華麗的裝飾也好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.89,0:21:34.48,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}都不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.69,0:21:36.52,edcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}餐桌上已經
